adius 999 goodTint, text 13 SemiBold good) ; '+6pts' 13 SemiBold good name 'Delta'; '850' 11 Regular ink3.\n  underRow hug width? fixed 200: set primaryAxisSizingMode FIXED resize(200,hug?) — height hug: counterAxis FIXED? For horizontal stack: primary=horizontal fixed 200, counter=vertical hug. resize(200,1) then primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED', counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'. resize(200, 20) then counter AUTO adjusts. OK.\n- 'Last update on 20 Jul 2020' 12 Regular ink3 name 'Updated'.\nGauge container: ellipse bottom half clipped by container height 106 ✓ (clip true).\nCard height ≈ 20+106+12+20+12+15+20 = 205.\n\nWait ellipse y=0 top half visible y 0..100 within 106 ✓. Score y=42: spans ~42..96 — inside hole mostly ✓.\n\nAssemble frames Call 4-6 then hotspots Call 7.\n\nFrame 01 assembly overrides (detail!):\n```js\nconst f=figma.createFrame();f.name='01_Expenses';f.resize(375,812);f.x=0;f.y=0;f.fills=[solid(C.bg)];f.clipsContent=true;\nf.appendChild(await comp('1:25').createInstance()) → status bar instance at 0,0.\nhome indicator: instance 1:35 at 0,778.\ntab instance: tbComp.createInstance() x0 y732 name 'Tab Bar'.\nheader instance x0 y44; override Title text stays 'Expenses' (default) ✓.\ncontent stack: stack VERTICAL gap12 padding: top12 left16 right16, width 375 fixed height 636 fixed; x0 y96; counterAxisAlignItems 'STRETCH'; primaryAxisSizingMode FIXED resize(375,636); clipsContent false.\nchildren:\n budget instance (BudgetCard comp)\n catHead: hstack width stretch gap 8 align CENTER: 'Categories' 17 Bold grow; icon More 22 ink2. (name 'Categories Header')\n autoCard = cardComp.createInstance() — defaults = Auto → no overrides!\n billCard = cardComp.createInstance() — overrides:\n   title.text='Bill & Utilities'; total.text='$320'; tile.fills=[solid(C.warnTint)];\n   nested icon: billCard.findOne(n=>n.name==='Icon_Car') → that's the icon instance inside tile. swapComponent(billComp) then recolor to warn: recolor uses findAll vectors set strokes — set strokes=