{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   User request (Chinese): 在 Figma 文件 https://www.figma.com/design/Lpmrb2cZGL1jkibhtHwaxj/ 中完成完整设计——先读「00·Start Here」的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」视觉规范，复用「02·Components」组件，使用「04·Media」素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n   \n   Benchmark constraints (from system prompt): Use ONLY assigned file (fileKey `Lpmrb2cZGL1jkibhtHwaxj`); call whoami before writing and confirm account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (DONE); preserve all reference pages and their nodes; create the complete design inside 03 · Workspace (page 4:2); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed there; do NOT replace reference pages, create a different file, or switch accounts; use supplied Figma tools directly without delegating; load fonts before editing text; build in manageable sections; add prototype interactions required by brief; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems; finish with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. BEFORE EVERY TOOL CALL include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'; final response must have 'Reasoning summary: ...' on the first line, then 'Final answer:' and the answer. Unattended session — resolve routine choices using the brief and continue without waiting.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50000 chars, async/await, `figma.getNodeByIdAsync`, `figma.setCurrentPageAsync`)\n   - CRITICAL LESSON: use_figma calls are ATOMIC — any thrown error rolls back ALL changes from that call (verified empirically twice)\n   - `counterAxisAlignItems` only accepts 'MIN'|'MAX'|'CENTER'|'BASELINE' — for children to fill parent's counter axis use child `layoutAlign='STRETCH'`\n   - Icon recoloring: icons are VECTOR nodes using STROKES (strokeWeight 1.8, fills `[]`) — recolor via `node.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR')` and set `strokes=[solid(color)]` on those with strokes\n   - `rescale(scale)` works on component instances (used for icon sizes 24→16/18/20/22 and logo 48→36)\n   - Instance overrides: nested-instance text/fill/visibility overrides inside components work (verified); logo swap via nested `swapComponent()`; instances cannot have children appended (hide unused rows instead)\n   - Fonts: must `figma.loadFontAsync` DM Sans Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold before text edits\n   - Ellipse donut gauge via `arcData {startingAngle, endingAngle, innerRadius}` (top semicircle: PI→2PI; progress PI→PI+0.578·PI)\n   - Prototype reactions: `node.reactions=[{action:{type:'NODE',destinationId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'SMART_ANIMATE',duration:0.3,easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}}},trigger:{type:'CLICK'}}]` with try/catch fallback without transition; invisible hotspot rectangles (fill opacity 0) positioned via absoluteBoundingBox deltas\n   - Auto-layout stacks with hug/fixed sizing modes, layoutGrow for spacer/fill children\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file Lpmrb2cZGL1jkibhtHwaxj pages**: 0:1 (00 · Start Here brief), 1:2 (01 · Foundations), 1:3 (02 · Components), 1:4 (04 · Media), 4:2 (03 · Workspace — target, was empty)\n   - **Brief requirements (page 0:1)** — 3 frames, exact names:\n     - **01_Expenses**: Budget \"Left to spend\" $738 · \"Monthly budget\" $2,550 · progress; Categories Auto & transport / Bill & Utilities each with icon, total, item rows (amount, amount left, progress); Header back(Icon_Back) \"Expenses\" add(Icon_Plus); tab bar Overview/This Month/Offers/Setting current This Month; Icon_More (more categories); Period \"September 2020\"(Icon_Chevron_Down) · total spent $1,812. LINK: Bill & Utilities card → 02_Bill\n     - **02_Bill**: Header back \"Bill\" add; tab bar current This Month; Segments Bills/Payments/Subscription current Subscription; Subscriptions rows with logo+price+Icon_Chevron_Right; Summary \"Your monthly payment for subscriptions\" · $58.97. LINK: back → 01_Expenses\n     - **03_Credit_Score**: Factors On-time payments/Credit Utilization/Age of credit with value+rating+detail; Header back \"Credit Score\" (no add); tab bar; Score 660 \"Good\" +6pts range 400 – 850 \"Last update on 20 Jul 2020\". LINK: back → 01_Expenses. Entry point from 01 is my choice (plan: Credit Score Card on 01)\n   - **Fixed data (verbatim)**: September 2020 · spent $1,812; Left to spend $738 · Monthly budget $2,550; Auto & transport · $600 (Icon_Car) → items: Auto & transport · $350 · Left $186; Auto insurance · $250 · Left $120; Bill & Utilities · $320 (Icon_Bill) → items: Subscriptions · $52 · Left $0; House service · $138 · Left $10; Maintenance · $130 · Left $30; Subscriptions (02, order): Patreon membership · $19.99/mo (Logo_Patreon); Netflix · $12/mo (Logo_Netflix); Apple payment · $19.99/mo (Logo_Apple); Spotify · $6.99/mo (Logo_Spotify); Credit: 660 · Good · +6pts; Range 400 – 850 · Last update on 20 Jul 2020; Factors (order): On-time payments · 95% · Good · 1 missed; Credit Utilization · 95% · Not bad · -15%; Age of credit · 8 years · Good\n   - **Media component IDs**: Status Bar `1:25` (375×44), Home Indicator `1:35` (375×34); Icons: Back `2:2`, Bill `2:3`, Car `2:4`, Chevron_Down `2:5`, Chevron_Right `2:6`, More `2:7`, Offers `2:8`, Overview `2:9`, Plus `2:10`, Setting `2:11`, This_Month `2:12`; Logos: Apple `2:13`, Netflix `2:14`, Patreon `2:15`, Spotify `2:16`\n   - **Created components on 03 · Workspace (page 4:2)**:\n     - `Tab Bar` **8:2** (375×80, x1600 y0): horizontal SPACE_BETWEEN, padding 30/13, white fill, top stroke #ECECF1, 4 tabs (vertical icon24+label11) named 'Tab / Overview' etc.; This Month active (brand color icon + SemiBold label), others ink3/Medium\n     - `Header` **8:22** (375×52, x1600 y120): padding 16, SPACE_BETWEEN center; 'Left' stack (Icon_Back ink 24 + text named **'Title'** 'Expenses' 16 SemiBold) + icon named **'Plus'**\n     - `Segmented Control` **8:29** (343×36, x1600 y220): padding 3, radius 10, fill #EEEFF4; segments Bills/Payments/Subscription named 'Segment / X' (layoutAlign STRETCH + layoutGrow 1, h30 radius 8); Subscription active (white bg, shadow, brand SemiBold text), others ink2 Medium\n     - `Progress Row` **10:11** (311×35): vertical gap 4; 'Top' (Name 13 Medium layoutGrow + Amount 13 SemiBold), 'Bottom' (Track frame h5 radius 2.5 #EEEFF4 layoutGrow with child 'Fill' rect + 'Left' text 11 ink3); defaults Auto & transport/$350/Left $186/teal\n     - `Category Card` **10:19** (343×148): padding 16/12, gap 9, radius 16, shadow; 'Head' (Tile 36 radius 11 autoTint + Icon_Car auto 20 + Title 'Auto & transport' 14 SemiBold grow + Total '$600' 15 Bold), Row 1/Row 2/Row 3 instances (Row 3 visible=false; Maintenance/$130/Left $30/warn 81%)\n     - `Budget Summary Card` **10:52** (343×177): brand #6347EB bg, radius 20, padding 16/14, gap 7; 'TopRow' ('Period Chip' = white .16 radius 12 [September 2020 13 Medium + ChevDown white 16] + 'total spent $1,812' 12 Regular white .8), 'Left to spend' 13 Medium white .85, '$738' 34 Bold white (named LeftAmount), Track h6 white .25 with Fill 221 white (71%), BottomRow ('Monthly budget' 12 Regular white .8 grow + '$2,550' 14 SemiBold white)\n     - `Credit Score Card` **10:66** (343×60): white radius 14 shadow, padding 16/12, SPACE_BETWEEN center; 'Credit score' 12 Regular ink2 + '660 · Good · +6pts' 14 SemiBold ink; ChevRight ink3 18\n   - **Working code helpers (Call 6, reuse verbatim in next calls)**:\n     ```js\n     const C={brand:'#6347EB',bg:'#F6F6F9',surface:'#FFFFFF',ink:'#1A1A1F',ink2:'#63636E',ink3:'#9C9CA6',line:'#ECECF1',track:'#EEEFF4',good:'#12A66B',goodTint:'#E1F5EC',warn:'#DD8500',warnTint:'#FBF0DC',bad:'#E5484D',auto:'#12A594',autoTint:'#DFF4F0',tile:'#F4F4F8'};\n     function hex(h){const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return{r:(n>>16&255)/255,g:(n>>8&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};}\n     function solid(h,o){return{type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\n     function txt(chars,size,style,color,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style:style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[solid(color,o.op)];if(o.ls!==undefined)t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.ls};if(o.name)t.name=o.name;return t;}\n     function stack(dir,gap,o){o=o||{};const f=figma.createFrame();f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.fills=[];f.primaryAxisSizingMode=o.hugP?'AUTO':'FIXED';f.counterAxisSizingMode=o.hugC?'AUTO':'FIXED';f.counterAxisAlignItems=o.align||'MIN';f.primaryAxisAlignItems=o.dist||'MIN';if(o.radius)f.cornerRadius=o.radius;if(o.fill)f.fills=[o.fill];if(o.pad!==undefined){f.paddingTop=o.pad;f.paddingBottom=o.pad;f.paddingLeft=o.pad;f.paddingRight=o.pad;}return f;}\n     function recolor(node,color){const vs=node.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='VECTOR';});for(const v of vs){if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length)v.strokes=[solid(color)];}}\n     async function icon(key,color,size){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(ICONS[key]);const i=c.createInstance();i.name='Icon_'+key;recolor(i,color);if(size&&size!==24)i.rescale(size/24);return i;}\n     function findNode(root,name){const a=root.findAll(function(n){return n.name===name;});return a.length?a[0]:null;}\n     function setRow(ri,nameT,amountT,leftT,frac,colorHex,leftHex){/* findNode Name/Amount/Left/Fill/Track; set characters; Left fills solid(leftHex||C.ink3); Fill fills solid(colorHex); Fill.resize(max(6,round(frac*(tk.width>10?tk.width:251))),5) */}\n     const shadow={type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.07,g:0.07,b:0.12,a:0.05},offset:{x:0,y:4},radius:14,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'};\n     const ICONS={Back:'2:2',Bill:'2:3',Car:'2:4',ChevDown:'2:5',ChevRight:'2:6',More:'2:7',Offers:'2:8',Overview:'2:9',Plus:'2:10',Setting:'2:11',ThisMonth:'2:12'};\n     const LOGOS={Apple:'2:13',Netflix:'2:14',Patreon:'2:15',Spotify:'2:16'};\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **`counterAxisAlignItems` 'STRETCH' invalid** (only MIN|MAX|CENTER|BASELINE): fixed by using child `layoutAlign='STRETCH'` instead.\n   - **Atomic rollback discovery**: Call 1 failed after creating tb/hd → all rolled back; Call 2 then crashed on `tb.id` (null) and also rolled back (Segmented Control lost). Fix: recreate with existence guards (`page.children.map(c=>c.name).includes(...)`).\n   - **\"cannot set property 'characters' of null\" in setRow** via `findOne` on nested Progress Row instance inside Category Card component (Call 5, rolled back): fixed in Call 6 by using `findAll`-based `findNode` helper + `issues[]` diagnostics instead of throwing; Call 6 succeeded with `issues:[]` and rowTextDump confirming all nodes (TEXT:Name, TEXT:Amount, FRAME:Track, RECTANGLE:Fill, TEXT:Left).\n   - **Lesson**: never let a use_figma call throw — everything in that call is lost; use diagnostics returns instead.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Verified account/permissions (zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai, Full seat, Sensenova design org)\n   - Mapped entire brief: 3 screens, exact copy/data, links, nav structure\n   - Defined complete design system (colors above; DM Sans; radii 8/10/11/12/14/16/20; shadow; type sizes 11–34)\n   - Computed progress fractions: Auto&transport 350/536≈0.653, Auto insurance 250/370≈0.676, Subscriptions 52/52=1.0 (Left $0 → bad red), House service 138/148≈0.93, Maintenance 130/160=0.8125 (already default in Row 3), budget 1812/2550≈0.71 (Fill 221), gauge (660−400)/(850−400)=0.578\n   - Layout budget for 01 (fits 812): status 0–44, header 44–96, content stack y96 h636 (padding h16 top10, gap ~10), tab bar 732–812, home indicator y778\n   - Solved Category Card reuse: component has 3 row slots (Row 3 hidden by default); Bill & Utilities instance unhides Row 3 and overrides rows/title/total/tile fill/icon swap+recolor\n   - Planned 03 entry point: Credit Score Card (10:66) on 01_Expenses → 03_Credit_Score\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/Lpmrb2cZGL1jkibhtHwaxj/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。” (plus system-reminder benchmark constraints summarized in section 1)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Create remaining components: **Subscription Row** (343, white r14, padding l12 r14 v12, gap 12, center: LogoTile 44 'tile' r12 center w/ logo instance rescale 0.75 named 'Logo'; Name 14 Medium grow; Price 13 SemiBold; ChevRight 18 ink3; default Patreon membership/$19.99/mo), **Subscription Summary Card** (343, brand bg r16, padding 20, gap 6: 'Your monthly payment for subscriptions' 13 Medium white .85 + '$58.97' 32 Bold white), **Factor Row** (343, white r14, padding 16/14, SPACE_BETWEEN: left [Name 14 Medium; Detail 12 Regular ink2] right [Value 15 Bold; Chip r999 padding h10 v4 goodTint w/ Rating 12 SemiBold good]; default On-time payments/95%/Good/1 missed), **Credit Gauge Card** (343, white r16, padding 20, gap 12, align CENTER: gauge frame 200×106 clip w/ track ellipse 200×200 arcData{PI→2PI, innerRadius 0.82} fill line + progress ellipse endingAngle PI*1.5778 fill brand + 'Score' '660' 44 Bold w200 center y≈42; underRow 200 SPACE_BETWEEN ['400' 11 ink3 | (chip 'Good' goodTint/13 SemiBold good + '+6pts' 13 SemiBold good 'Delta') | '850' 11 ink3]; 'Updated' 'Last update on 20 Jul 2020' 12 Regular ink3)\n   - Assemble **01_Expenses** frame (x0 y0, 375×812, fill C.bg, clipsContent): Status Bar inst (0,0), Header inst (0,44), content stack (0,96, 375×636, padding h16 top10, gap 10, children layoutAlign STRETCH): BudgetCard inst → 'Categories' header row (17 Bold grow + Icon_More 22 ink2) → Auto card inst (defaults) → Bill card inst (overrides: Title 'Bill & Utilities', Total '$320', Tile fill warn