\":\"10:19\",\"bc\":\"10:52\",\"cc\":\"10:66\",\"rowH\":35,\"cardH\":148,\"bcH\":177,\"ccH\":60,\"issues\":[],\"rowTextDump\":[\"TEXT:Name\",\"TEXT:Amount\",\"FRAME:Track\",\"RECTANGLE:Fill\",\"TEXT:Left\"]}`. All overrides applied cleanly (issues empty). Component inventory now: 8:2 Tab Bar, 8:22 Header, 8:29 Segmented Control, 10:11 Progress Row, 10:19 Category Card, 10:52 Budget Summary Card, 10:66 Credit Score Card — all positioned at x1600 in a components zone.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Create the final four business components in one use_figma call (atomic — keep it error-free per lesson learned): Subscription Row, Subscription Summary Card, Factor Row, Credit Gauge Card, positioned at x1600 with y offsets continuing from existing zone (e.g., y=1060+), using the exact helper code and specs from section 7. This directly continues the build plan stated before Call 6: \"重建时改用更稳健的 findAll 查找并收集诊断信息…先重建这批业务组件\" — the remaining components were explicitly planned (\"Call 3: SubRow+FactorRow+GaugeCard\") before frame assembly (Calls 4–6: frames 01/02/03), prototype wiring (Call 7), then screenshots. Per the brief: \"Build exactly the 3 frames below, named exactly as listed… and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/huangxinyue/bench-runs/10case-rerun2-glm/runs/TEST-013_1793607948953/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-huangxinyue-bench-runs-10case-rerun2-glm-workspace/88fa287b-e3f1-4759-ae42-7b214809a163.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbat