{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Key insight: V1/V2 error: \"Please update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field in order to prevent data loss.\" — so the format IS right (with transition), but the setter wants `actions` (plural) field in the reaction object! So the reaction is:\n\n{actions: [{...action...}], trigger: {type:'ON_CLICK'}}\n\nNewer Plugin API: Reaction = {actions: Action[], trigger: Trigger}? Actually current API: `node.reactions` array of Reaction where Reaction = {trigger, action} — but there's a newer multi-action format: {trigger, actions: [...]}. The error explicitly says use `actions` field.\n\nSo try: [{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}, actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{...}}]}]\n\nTest variants:\nW1: {trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:'15:155',navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'SMART_ANIMATE',duration:300,easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}}}]}\nW2: duration 0.3 if 300 invalid.\nW3: no transition fallback.","signature":"1b67db5493b24e68bad4d4a1"}],"id":"d1759560-0c8e-4f6f-ae8c-57aa0792c7fb","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88fa287b-e3f1-4759-ae42-7b214809a163","uuid":"4c6d574a-a5fd-49ce-b3cf-82c956bd367b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:59:39.341Z","thinking_duration_ms":6762}
